    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1754879969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1754879969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1754879969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1754879969\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/36f07bb71c101cb425a77df2f12a381f.avif?t=1754879969\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Idol cultivation process \uff1aunspoken rules \u2605\u30df&quot; is a short adult idol Raising simulation game developed by nikukyu and published by 072 Project.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work for an idol agency that is on the verge of closing down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a producer, your goal is to train the last remaining idol, &quot;Yumesaki&quot; into a &quot;perfect idol&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/862bcd90fb139a262bfdb68f54382f7b.avif?t=1754879969\" /></span>You finally joined the dream Management Company, 0721 Project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But on your first day at work, you were informed about 0721's impending bankruptcy!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the struggling 0721, you take on the role of the last idol, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Yumesaki Humino,&quot; as her manager.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/35bc786190896b70179049812337bf40.avif?t=1754879969\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dancing,&quot; &quot;singing,&quot; &quot;skills,&quot; &quot;charisma&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in four different courses and strive towards the &quot;N Stage&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/7c2e6eba6e2d081a74f2afc1616c148f.avif?t=1754879969\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intimate interactions with the idol and guide her in this short-story </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >simulation management game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/482740024706c710f2ec9607437ba0f8.avif?t=1754879969\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the producer of &quot;Humino&quot; you must do everything possible to get her on stage and fulfill her wishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > To achieve this, you need to manage her schedule effectively to enhance her various abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in classes, audition for various small stages, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can also work to earn money and use your own wallet to help Humino dress up in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Humino's dream is in your hands to make it come true!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/2f62d96b04a645da94171c9649984fe8.avif?t=1754879969\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip message</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding text box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full screen mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG Gallery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
